    "description": "<b>Convert to pdf: Super Simple Image to PDF Converter</b>\r\nPDF converter is now an indispensable tool in the office as well as in study or daily life. This is a PDF conversion application that can help you do your work, serve documents for students in the fastest way.\r\n\r\nNot only helps to convert document files, photos to PDF, the application also has many other features that can edit and read PDF; Moreover, it also saves time and works very effectively. All useful features are encapsulated in this pocket app.\r\n\r\n<b>Main feature of the JPG to pdf converter app:</b>\r\n\u2b50NEW Feature: Scan Document to PDF- Smart Detected Text\r\n\r\n<b>\u25baPictures to pdf, photos to PDF Converter:</b>\r\n\u2b50 Convert JPG to PDF, PNG to pdf convert picture to pdf\r\n\u2b50 Photo pdf converter\r\n\u2b50 Text to PDF\r\n\u2b50 Convert PDF to Text\r\n\u2b50 Excel to PDF converter\r\n\u2b50 Password Protect PDF\r\n\u2b50 Unlock PDF\r\n\u2b50 PDF export\r\n\r\n<b>\u25baEdit files, PDF documents:</b>\r\n\u2b50 PDF Editor helps you edit PDF files conveniently\r\n\u2b50 PDF markup tools like underline, highlight pdf, notes, PDF signature\r\n\u2b50 Simple PDF Editor\r\n\r\n<b>\u25baPDF Reader - PDF Viewer all in one:</b>\r\n\u2b50 Simple PDF Reader App\r\n\u2b50 Easily search for files with the search function.\r\n\u2b50 The easy-to-use, intuitive interface allows users to view the entire PDF file from the file manager or directly from the application.\r\n\u2b50 Scroll PDF document pages.\r\n\u2b50 Print PDF files directly from your mobile phone.\r\n\u2b50 Multiple view modes: Dark mode & light mode\r\n\u2b50 View and bookmark recent PDFs\r\n\r\n<b>\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc6Advanced Features of the Photo to PDF converter App:</b>\r\n\u2b50 Add watermark in PDF\r\n\u2b50 Merge PDF files\r\n\u2b50 Split PDF documents into multiple files\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udc4d Why should you use this PDF converter app?</b>\r\n\ufe0f\ud83e\udd47Simple operation, easy to use: you can rename, delete, share the document or organize PDF\r\n\ufe0f\ud83e\udd47Support reading all document file formats: notes, receipts, invoices, forms, business cards, certificates, identity cards,...\r\n\ufe0f\ud83e\udd47No Internet required, you can still view PDF files from anywhere, anytime you want.\r\n\ufe0f\ud83e\udd47Friendly & smart interface: refresh the list, pinch to zoom, fast page navigate\r\n\ufe0f\ud83e\udd47Create new PDF page by yourself\r\n\r\nNow you can easy-to-use the application without having to open your laptop or desktop to download documents and convert to PDF. Especially for students, who want to quickly send homework, assignment, worksheet documents to teachers just through a smart phone.\r\n\r\nUse this pocket super handy app to discover more about other features. We will always update regularly to bring you the best experience. If you have any requests or questions, please contact us via email: Trustedapp.help@gmail.com. Thank you! \u2764\ufe0f",
